{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514380/extras/x_vOxz.png?t=1742704281\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter a chilling spirit world and unravel the dark mysteries of your death in this  atmospheric indie horror game.\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514380/extras/Guy6GM.png?t=1742704281\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514380/extras/GIFS__1232_x_706_px___2_.gif?t=1742704281\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i><strong>Interstice - Journey into Darkness</strong></i>, you step into the role of a lost soul trapped in the eerie limbo between life and death. Navigate an ever-changing environment and uncover fragments of your forgotten memories. <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514380/extras/oj_c3F.png?t=1742704281\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514380/extras/GIFS__1232_x_706_px___1_.gif?t=1742704281\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immersive Exploration</strong> \u2013 Wander through chilling environments filled with cryptic clues and hidden memories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Narrative-Driven Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Shape your story and uncover the secrets of your demise through fragmented memories and atmospheric discovery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Atmospheric Design</strong> \u2013 Experience a haunting, immersive world crafted to evoke tension and mystery at every turn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Environmental Storytelling</strong> \u2013 No floating icons. No handholding. Observe your surroundings to drive the narrative and piece the story together.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3514380?t=1742704281","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514380/a6538c779d34ef292f17a78bcf24b541d3b2dbad/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742704281","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514380/a9899292ef9c9c5601ba5e87747f3d23c9200bd7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742704281","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514380/a9899292ef9c9c5601ba5e87747f3d23c9200bd7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742704281","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains mature themes, including depictions of violence and abuse as part of the storyline. These elements are integral to the narrative and are presented in a way that supports the game's atmosphere and storytelling. Player discretion is advised."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514380/extras/x_vOxz.png?t=1742704281\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter a chilling spirit world and unravel the dark mysteries of your death in this  atmospheric indie horror game.\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514380/extras/Guy6GM.png?t=1742704281\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514380/extras/GIFS__1232_x_706_px___2_.gif?t=1742704281\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i><strong>Interstice - Journey into Darkness</strong></i>, you step into the role of a lost soul trapped in the eerie limbo between life and death. Navigate an ever-changing environment and uncover fragments of your forgotten memories. <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514380/extras/oj_c3F.png?t=1742704281\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514380/extras/GIFS__1232_x_706_px___1_.gif?t=1742704281\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immersive Exploration</strong> \u2013 Wander through chilling environments filled with cryptic clues and hidden memories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Narrative-Driven Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Shape your story and uncover the secrets of your demise through fragmented memories and atmospheric discovery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Atmospheric Design</strong> \u2013 Experience a haunting, immersive world crafted to evoke tension and mystery at every turn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Environmental Storytelling</strong> \u2013 No floating icons. No handholding. Observe your surroundings to drive the narrative and piece the story together.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Havock Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/351438